<title>UK: FEK sets 250 million stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 250 million stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europw) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    16.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.10     PAY DATE  S 17.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/FI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
